                            toolbarOverlap 0, status "Items grouped side by side into a new zone."
50 % zoom:                  the same orientation/reorder rules were exercised in the P0-29 centre
                            rule probe (thresholds use screen px); grouping/reorder use the same
                            screen-px dominance and hysteresis.
390 x 844:                  grouped vertical 274 x 275 at (28.4, 94.7), insideWorld true.
```

